# Uploaded files. These live in the `app_storage` Docker volume on the server
# and are moved between machines with tar/rsync, never through git (see
# DEPLOY.md). On Windows `public/storage` is a real copy of storage/app/public
# instead of the symlink `php artisan storage:link` creates.
